published as several repositories. pqcaton is built against four of them:

  pqcota-common     — https://github.com/randyinthedev-hash/pqcota-common
  pqcota-inventory  — https://github.com/randyinthedev-hash/pqcota-inventory
  pqcota-discovery  — https://github.com/randyinthedev-hash/pqcota-discovery
  pqcota-provisioning — https://github.com/randyinthedev-hash/pqcota-provisioning

