pqcaton consumes pqcota through its published modules (the contracts in
pqcota-common, and packages of pqcota-inventory, pqcota-discovery and
pqcota-provisioning) and does not
modify pqcota itself. Where pqcota source is included in a distribution of
pqcaton, it remains under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The documentation site tools in tools/site (assemble.py, build.sh, check_site.py,
langswitch.py, mkdocs.base.yml and mkdocs.ko.base.yml) are derived from pqcota's
tools/site at commit 8a4e9bf060416533fab9d40dcce8427d81e10faa (v0.13.0) and were
modified for pqcaton. They remain under the Apache License, Version 2.0: each of
them says so in its header, the changes are listed in docs/site.md, and the
license text is in LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.

